35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle, and the lab is short-staffed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The paperwork delays are real, and transport costs are a third of installation.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"People come back for live demonstrations, not just static cases.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The bay has a weight limit, and powered displays need frequent maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Joiner rates are up, and evening hires damage open displays.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, does the weight limit rule out heavy stonework?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Yes, and the transport costs make loans expensive.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"So we need something with people present, but not too heavy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,The maintenance log shows many call-outs for moving parts.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,That means we should avoid complex powered installations.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The town history circle could guide a local history show.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,But the transport costs for loans are high.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,Local items would avoid those costs.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,And they would fit the structural limits.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,And the joiner's rate would be lower for local items.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,It seems like a local exhibition is the safest bet.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I agree, the risks are lower.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,And the visitors will enjoy the live elements.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The building will be safe.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,And the budget will be predictable.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
